; 0</code>.</li>
<li>All values of <code>j</code> such that <strong><code>prefix_sum[j] =3D=
=3D k</code></strong> when <code>i =3D=3D 0</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p>We can unify both cases by recognizing that the formula prefix_sum[j] =
